title: Account Password Reset by Another User
id: 30d8776c-98f0-4797-946a-51a24e3e83b2
status: experimental
description: Detects an administrative password reset of another account (event 4724) or account re-enable (4722), which can be abused to take over a target account for persistence.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/
logsource:
  product: windows
  service: security
detection:
  selection:
    EventID:
      - 4724
      - 4722
  filter:
    SubjectUserName|fieldref: TargetUserName
  condition: selection and not filter
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SubjectUserName
  - TargetUserName
  - IpAddress
falsepositives:
  - Help desk password resets
level: medium
tags:
  - attack.persistence
  - attack.t1098
